# VERDICT (pinned): the in_worker_cold/LocalKey frames carry the
# enclosed bridged WORK's samples, not recoverable overhead. The
# historic direct-call at threads<=1 stands; code reverted byte-exact,
# doc updated with both rejections. Do not respawn without new
# structure.
